guardsman watcher guard~
the Watcher guardsman~
A guardsman of the Order of the Watchers stands beside the door, keeping watch.
~
The guardsman wears a polished breastplate with a golden setting sun
worked into its center, and a red and yellow tattoo of the sun circles
his right eye. He stands straight and still, one hand resting on the
hilt of his sword, and his gaze follows everyone who crosses the foyer.
The Watchers have sworn to uphold the laws of the land, and he looks as
though he has never broken one in his life.
~
